Author: Tzvetan Mikov <tmikov@meta.com>
Date:   Fri Jan 12 20:00:51 2024 -0800

    Remove dangerous overload of isAllASCII()

    Summary:
    isAllASCII() had a slow overload that could accidentally be invoked, for
    example when using an iterator instead of a pointer. That overload
    served no useful purpose, so remove it.

    Note that the problem hasn't happened yet. This diff doesn't affect
    performance, it only prevents it in the future.

    Reviewed By: neildhar

    Differential Revision: D52649630

    fbshipit-source-id: 86d59ef1062f4667de1ccb908169ed57a5c897a9
